      * Print heading of Reserve Worksheet.
     A          R HDRWRK
     A                                      SPACEB(3)
     A                                    49'Reserve Worksheet'
     A                                      HIGHLIGHT SPACEA(2)
     A                                      FONT(416  (*POINTSIZE 13))
     A            DCLMNAM       60        49
     A                                      HIGHLIGHT SPACEA(3)
     A                                      FONT(416  (*POINTSIZE 13))
     A                                     4'Claim#:'
     A            DCLMNU        15       +16
     A                                    70'Approved By:'
     A            DAPRBY        40        +7
     A                                      SPACEA(1)
     A                                     4'Date Of Injury:'
     A            DDTINJ        10        +8
     A                                    70'Approval Date:'
     A            DAPRDT        10        +5
     A                                      SPACEA(1)
     A                                     4'Jurisdiction State:'
     A            DJRSST        40        +4
     A                                    70'Total Incurred:'
     A            DTTINC        11  2     +4EDTCDE(J $)
     A                                      SPACEA(1)

      * Print Line
     A          R RLINE
     A                                      SPACEB(1)
     A                                     4'_________________________________-
     A                                      __________________________________-
     A                                      __________________________________-
     A                                      ________________'

      * Print Section Header
     A          R HSECHDR                   SPACEB(2)
     A            DSECHDR       40         4
     A                                      HIGHLIGHT
     A                                      SPACEA(1)

      * Print Benefit Details.
     A          R DTLBEN
     A            DBENHDG       40         4
     A            DBENPER        3        41
     A            DBENTIT        2        45
     A                                      HIGHLIGHT
     A            DBENTO        15        48
     A            DWEEK          3  0     65EDTCDE(J)
     A                                    70'X'
     A            DCMPRT         7  2     73EDTCDE(J)
     A                                    83'='
     A                                      FONT(416  (*POINTSIZE 11))
     A            DAMT          11  2     89EDTCDE(J $)
     A            DRCODE        15       107
     A                                      SPACEA(1)

     A          R DTLSUB
     A                                    64'Weeks'
     A                                      FONT(416  (*POINTSIZE 7))
     A                                    74'Comp Rate'
     A                                      FONT(416  (*POINTSIZE 7))
     A                                    99'Amount'
     A                                      FONT(416  (*POINTSIZE 7))
     A            DSUBRSV       12       107
     A                                      FONT(416  (*POINTSIZE 7))
     A                                      SPACEA(1)

     A          R DTLPER
     A            DBNPR          1        41
     A                                      SPACEA(1)

      * Print Amount Details.
     A          R DTLAMT
     A            DAMTHDG       40         4
     A            DAMTDTL       11  2     89EDTCDE(J $)
     A            DRCDE         15       107
     A                                      SPACEA(1)

     A          R DTLAMS
     A                                    99'Amount'
     A                                      FONT(416  (*POINTSIZE 7))
     A            DAMSRSV       12       107
     A                                      FONT(416  (*POINTSIZE 7))
     A                                      SPACEA(1)

      * Print Reserve Details.
     A          R DTLRSV
     A            DRSVHDG       50         4
     A            DRSVAMT       11  2     89EDTCDE(J $)
     A                                      SPACEA(1)

      * Print Toatl Details.
     A          R DTLTOT
     A                                      SPACEB(2)
     A                                    34'Total Recommended Changes'
     A            DTOTCHG       11  2     89EDTCDE(J $)
     A                                      SPACEA(1)
     A                                    34'Total Incurred (after changes)'
     A            DTOTINC       11  2     89EDTCDE(J $)
     A                                      SPACEA(1)

      * Print Notes
     A          R DNOTE
     A            DNTCMT       118         4SPACEA(1)

      * PAGE BREAK
     A          R DPGBRK
     A                                      SKIPB(3)
